At a high level, instead of relying solely on form-based inputs, we could introduce an AI-powered assistant that interacts with users to capture API requirements, generate or validate OAS specifications, and automate repository and pipeline actions. This could help reduce manual effort, improve standardisation, and enhance the overall developer experience.

I believe this approach could complement our existing design by improving onboarding speed, reducing validation issues, and making the process more intuitive for teams across the bank.

